feat: publish initial Insights articles

Add three complete Insights articles covering custom software, POS/ERP
selection, and practical AI for business operations. Store article content
in src/data/insights.ts and link the Insights listing to dedicated detail
pages at /insights/:slug, with article-specific metadata and standard 404
handling for unknown slugs.

Remove the Coming soon badges and article placeholder copy. Keep Insights
available in the existing header and footer navigation.

Validation: npm run build passes; ESLint passes for the changed feature
files. Responsive checks at 360px, 768px, and desktop in light and dark
themes passed. Repository-wide lint still reports 14 pre-existing errors
in unrelated files.

# ── Commit message template ───────────────────────────────────────
# Line 1: short summary (max ~60 chars), starting with a type:
#   fix:      a bug fix                fix: stop case study page scrolling sideways on mobile
#   feat:     a new feature or section feat: add first insights article
#   design:   layout / visual change   design: make chat button compact on mobile
#   chore:    cleanup, config, deps    chore: remove leftover Vite template files
#   docs:     README / docs only       docs: add deployment notes
#
# Line 2: leave empty.
# Line 3+: (optional) what you changed and why.
#
# Last line: link the issue
#   Refs #12    → links the commit to issue #12 (use while work is in progress)
#   Closes #12  → closes issue #12 when this reaches the main branch
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
